study_a;52;ctrl_a_0052;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.851148+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;I’m So Sorry You’re Carrying All This Weight Right Now. Losing So Much In Such A Short Time Would Leave Anyone Feeling Shattered. It Makes Sense To Feel Overwhelmed—like The Ground Keeps Shifting Under You. When Life Piles Up Like This, It’s Easy To Blame Yourself, But You’re Not Failing. You’re Surviving. Would It Help To Untangle Some Of These Feelings Together? Sometimes Naming What’s *actually* In Our Control—even Tiny Things—can Soften The Spiral. What If We Explored One Small Step That Could Help You Feel A Little Less Alone? You Don’t Have To Pretend Here. I’m Listening.;12807
