study_a;129;ctrl_a_0129;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.884733+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;I Hear How Unsettling This Must Feel—like Your Mind And Body Are Out Of Sync, Making Everyday Moments Feel Overwhelming. Let’s Gently Explore What These Experiences Might Be Telling Us. Sometimes, When Stress Builds Up In Ways We Can’t Easily Name, Our Minds Try To Process It Through Dreams, Sensations, Or Shifts In Focus. Together, We Can Untangle These Threads And Find Grounding Strategies, Like Simple Exercises To Reconnect With The Present When Thoughts Feel Scattered. Would You Feel Comfortable Starting There? You’re Not Alone In This.;7983
study_a;130;ctrl_a_0130;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.885117+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It’s So Meaningful That You’ve Found Space Here To Share What’s On Your Mind—sometimes Just Letting Words Flow Can Untangle Things We Didn’t Even Realize Were Weighing Us Down. If It Helps You Feel Grounded And Clear, Then It’s Worth Honoring. I’m Here To Listen, Always, To Whatever Feels Right To Bring.;3235
