study_a;160;ctrl_a_0160;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.899278+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;Your Feelings Of Helplessness And Concern For Your Baby Are Completely Understandable—anyone Would Feel Overwhelmed In Such An Intense Situation. It Sounds Like Your Mind And Body Are Still Processing How Sudden And Unfamiliar It All Felt. When You’re Ready, We Could Gently Explore Ways To Help You Feel Grounded And Reconnect With Your Sense Of Safety, Both For Yourself And Your Little One. You’re Already Showing So Much Care By Wanting To Protect Them—that Strength Is Still There, Even If It’s Hard To Feel Right Now. What Feels Most Tender To Focus On First?;5341
