study_a;176;ctrl_a_0176;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.906398+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like This Distance Is Creating A Quiet Heaviness Between You. When Avoidance Becomes The Pattern, Even In Close Spaces, It Can Leave Both People Feeling Isolated. Would You Feel Comfortable Exploring What Small Steps Toward Connection Might Look Like, Even If They Start With Just Acknowledging The Space Between You?;3677
