study_a;188;ctrl_a_0188;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.911855+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like There’s A Quiet Hum Of Worry Running Through Your Days, Even When Things Feel Manageable. That Tension—especially When It Lingers In The Background—can Be Exhausting, Both Mentally And Physically. Would It Help To Explore How These Thoughts Show Up And Gently Untangle What Keeps Them Coming Back? Sometimes, Slowing Down To Notice Patterns Or Grounding Yourself In The Present Moment Can Create Space To Breathe. Small Steps Toward Rest, Like A Calming Bedtime Routine, Might Also Ease The Fatigue. You’re Carrying A Lot, Even If It Doesn’t Feel Overwhelming. How Does That Land For You?;479
