study_a;277;ctrl_a_0277;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.949531+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;Your Frustration And Fear Make So Much Sense—it’s So Hard When Something Weighs On You This Heavily. That Spiral Of “what Ifs” Can Feel All-consuming. Could We Gently Untangle This Together? Sometimes What Feels True In The Moment (like Certainty Things Will Go Wrong) Doesn’t Align With Reality. What Happens If We Pause, Take A Breath, And Ask: *What Evidence Do I Have That The Worst Will Happen?* *If A Friend Felt This Way, What Kindness Might I Offer Them?* You’re Holding So Much Right Now—let’s Find Space To Set Some Of It Down.;18721
