study_a;280;ctrl_a_0280;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.950919+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;"I Hear How Heavy This Fear Feels—how It Grips Your Body And Mind. That Constant Dread Of ""what If"" Can Be Exhausting. Let’s Gently Unpack Those Moments When The Panic Rises. What If We Explore The Stories You Tell Yourself About Money And Safety? Are They Rooted In What’s Actually Happening Now, Or In Fears Of What *could* Happen? Sometimes Naming The Specific Worries—and Separating Them From Facts—helps Shrink Their Power. Would It Feel Safe To Try Grounding In Small, Practical Steps Together? You’re Already Showing Courage By Facing This. We’ll Move At Your Pace.";12493
