study_a;285;ctrl_a_0285;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:46.953300+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like Those Moments Away From The Screen Give Space For Something Real To Surface—maybe A Mix Of Emotions That Feel Too Weighty To Hold. Distraction Can Be A Refuge When The Alternative Feels Overwhelming. What If, When That Heaviness Comes, You Paused Just Long Enough To Notice What’s Beneath It? Not To Fix It Right Away, But To Let It Exist Without Judgment, Like Observing A Wave That Eventually Recedes. You Don’t Have To Face It All At Once, But Even Small Glimpses Might Help You Understand What Your Mind Is Asking For. How Does That Feel To Consider?;11918
