study_a;413;ctrl_a_0413;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.013073+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like You’re Carrying A Lot Right Now—the Loss Of Joy, The Struggle With Sleep And Appetite, The Weight Of Feeling Stuck. Even Though Your Energy And Self-worth Haven’t Wavered, This Heaviness Is Real, And I’m Glad You’re Sharing It. Let’s Explore What Might Be Keeping You In This Cycle. When You Notice Your Mood Dipping, What Thoughts Or Situations Tend To Surface? Sometimes Untangling Those Patterns Can Create Space For Small, Meaningful Shifts—like Gentle Steps Toward Reconnecting With Activities That Once Brought Comfort, Or Building Routines That Support Rest And Nourishment. What Feels Manageable To Try, Even In Tiny Ways? You’re Not Alone In This.;565
