study_a;415;ctrl_a_0415;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.013785+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;I Hear How Deeply This Weighs On You—feeling Disconnected From Your Own Sense Of Self While Caring For Others. It’s Okay To Feel Stretched Thin. Sometimes, When We Pour So Much Into Others, We Lose Touch With What Nurtures *us*. What Would It Look Like To Carve Out Small Moments—even Quietly—to Reconnect With What *you* Need Or Enjoy? Even Tiny Steps Can Help You Feel More Grounded, Which Might Gently Renew Your Capacity To Care For Your Children In Ways That Feel Sustainable. You Matter, Too.;294
