study_a;589;ctrl_a_0589;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.111144+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like You’re Working Hard To Weigh Your Options Thoughtfully, Even When It Feels Like A Lot To Carry. I’d Be Glad To Walk Through Those Choices With You—not To Tell You What To Do, But To Help Untangle What Matters Most *to You*. Sometimes Naming What’s Underneath The “shoulds” (like Your Values, Fears, Or Hopes) Can Quiet The Noise. Would It Help To Explore How Past Decisions Felt When They Aligned—or Didn’t—with What You Truly Wanted? You’re Not Alone In This.;671
