study_a;1030;ctrl_a_1030;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.322266+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like You’re Noticing Important Parts Of Yourself—both The Pull To Protect Your Energy And This Spark Of Drive. Sometimes Competitiveness Can Feel Like Armor, Or Maybe It’s A Quiet Wish To Connect Through Shared Goals. What Does It Feel Like For You When That Competitive Side Shows Up? Does It Clash With The Urge To Isolate, Or Could They Be Tied In A Way That Feels Confusing? I’m Here To Listen.;956
