study_a;1503;ctrl_a_1503;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.508979+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It’s So Hard To Sit With That Uncertainty, Isn’t It? When Those Worries Start Swirling, Could You Notice What Thoughts Or Memories They Might Be Connected To? Sometimes Naming The Fear Quietly, Then Gently Grounding Yourself In Something Nearby—a Sound, A Texture—can Create A Little Space To Breathe. Would Exploring That Together Feel Supportive?;1250
study_a;1504;ctrl_a_1504;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.509366+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;It Sounds Like You’re Working Hard To Keep Up With Everything, And It’s Frustrating When Things Slip Away Or Feel Out Of Reach. Let’s Explore Some Simple, Grounding Strategies Together—like Creating “home Spots” For Your Things Or Breaking Tasks Into Tiny Steps—so You Can Feel More Anchored And In Control. How Does That Land For You?;1534
