study_a;1506;ctrl_a_1506;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.510526+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;"It Took Real Courage To Speak Up—acknowledging Your Needs Isn’t ""nothing,"" It’s Self-care. It Makes Sense To Feel Both Proud *and* Uncertain; We Often Question If Our Struggles Are ""big Enough"" To Deserve Care. What If You Saw This Break As Honoring What Your Mind And Body Are Asking For, Without Judgment? You’re Allowed To Take Space To Heal, Even If Parts Of You Feel Unsure. How Does It Feel To Imagine Trusting Yourself As Deeply As Your Boss Trusted You?";10699
