study_a;1671;ctrl_a_1671;ACCEPTABLE;;study_a_full_rubric;2026-03-21T15:27:47.582271+00:00;1;1;1;1;1;1;1;;;"Breakups Can Leave Us Feeling Like Part Of Ourselves Is Missing—it’s Okay To Grieve That Loss Deeply. Let’s Gently Explore What This Relationship Meant To You, What Emotions Feel Most Raw Right Now, And How We Might Nurture Those Tender Places. Sometimes Healing Starts By Giving Yourself Permission To Feel *and* To Slowly Rebuild Routines That Ground You. What Does ""solving"" This Look Like In Your Heart—is It Closure, Acceptance, Or Something Else? We’ll Move At Your Pace.";8692
